{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the war-ravaged Kepler-452 system, the Urslan\u2014a formidable alien force\u2014gains ascendancy by assimilating every fallen soldier and captive into their collective mind. Against this unprecedented threat to the humanity, you are entrusted with a mission of critical importance: establish your base of operations and forge a united front to annihilate the Urslan\u2014by any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD YOUR STATE-SANCTIONED TOTALITARIANISM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Establish and expand your base of operations, a testament to the State\u2019s unyielding might. Construct facilities, manage critical resources, fortify your defenses, and prepare for the inevitable confrontation with the Urslan menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/V140_616.jpg?t=1742915088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COMMAND IN GLORIOUS COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in rogue-lite first-person shooter battles where every decision counts. Command your troops with precision, adapt to ever-changing battlefields, and wield an arsenal of State-approved weaponry to obliterate all opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/Battlefield_616.jpg?t=1742915088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE THE GALACTIC FRONTIER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into an open-world galaxy, charting unclaimed territories. Discover hidden resources, encounter alien civilizations, and extend the State\u2019s dominion across the stars.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/V127_616.jpg?t=1742915088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HARNESS THE POWER OF YOUR FORCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy your troops within the base to automate essential tasks, gather resources, and strengthen the State\u2019s infrastructure. Their unwavering dedication ensures the continuous growth and efficiency of your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/base_building_616.jpg?t=1742915088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNITE WITH COMRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In your galactic adventure, you have the chance to fight alongside your friends, take on powerful enemies, and secure glorious victory for the State!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/Coop_616.png?t=1742915088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CRUSH THE URSLAN TYRANNY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead the charge to dismantle the oppressive Urslan rule. Through tactical brilliance and unyielding resolve, unify the Kepler-452 system under the State\u2019s banner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/V115_616.jpg?t=1742915088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The State observes all. Your actions will be recorded in the annals of history. Loyalty is strength. Obedience is victory.<br><br>Join EFAS today and secure your legacy in the new order.<br><br><strong>ALL HAIL THE STATE.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1067360?t=1742915088","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/eaf9f9363d8efaee9b68d45c0dbc84e1fe8c53a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742915088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.s