ever-changing battlefields, and wield an arsenal of State-approved weaponry to obliterate all opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/Battlefield_616.jpg?t=1742915088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE THE GALACTIC FRONTIER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into an open-world galaxy, charting unclaimed territories. Discover hidden resources, encounter alien civilizations, and extend the State\u2019s dominion across the stars.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/V127_616.jpg?t=1742915088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HARNESS THE POWER OF YOUR FORCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy your troops within the base to automate essential tasks, gather resources, and strengthen the State\u2019s infrastructure. Their unwavering dedication ensures the continuous growth and efficiency of your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/base_building_616.jpg?t=1742915088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNITE WITH COMRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In your galactic adventure, you have the chance to fight alongside your friends, take on powerful enemies, and secure glorious victory for the State!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/Coop_616.png?t=1742915088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CRUSH THE URSLAN TYRANNY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead the charge to dismantle the oppressive Urslan rule. Through tactical brilliance and unyielding resolve, unify the Kepler-452 system under the State\u2019s banner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/V115_616.jpg?t=1742915088\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The State observes all. Your actions will be recorded in the annals of history. Loyalty is strength. Obedience is victory.<br><br>Join EFAS today and secure your legacy in the new order.<br><br><strong>ALL HAIL THE STATE.</strong></p>","developers":["Multiverse"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Earth From Another Sun Game Account ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/279ead86942983eda359c12396dd1dad9127b550/header.jpg?t=1742915088","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115748,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115748/movie480.mp4?t=1742261334","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115748/movie_max.mp4?t=1742261334"},"name":"Earth From Another Sun Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257115748/16029f01eac04f1795d003770718b3bc1af69c47/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742261334","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115748/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742261334","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115748/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742261334"}}],"name":"Earth From Another Sun","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS\u00ae 10 (64-BIT Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8600 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1080p: Nvidia